<title>NETHERLANDS: Pakhoed ups stake in Univar to 100 pct.</title>
<headline>Pakhoed ups stake in Univar to 100 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch tank storage and shipping group Pakhoed NV said on Tuesday it had increased its stake in Univar to 100 percent from 95.5 percent.</p>
<p>In July, Pakhoed raised its stake in Univar from 28.09 percent to 95.5 percent.</p>
<p>Univar is a leading chemicals distributor with annual turnover of about two billion dollars.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
